### Fig27 Source Inventory, Not Modern Approval

Source: p73 original, one shared figure with two side-by-side framed coordinate-grid panels, labelled а) and б), and one caption below both. Ex186 explicitly refers to this figure. The candidate has one `fig 图 27` declaration and a separate `cap 图 27`, correctly preserving that shared ownership.

- Both panels have an observed finite lattice of **18 columns by 12 rows of cells** (19 vertical and 13 horizontal grid lines including the frame). There is a gap between frames. These counts are manual observations from the single original view, not generated-spec counts or pixel-snapped measurements.
- In each frame the vertical axis is on the ninth cell boundary from the left and the horizontal axis on the sixth row boundary from the top. The printed `1` labels indicate a unit spanning two small grid cells. No separate invented ticks or extra negative-number labels are source facts.
- Left panel: source labels а), `x`, `y`, origin glyph `O`, horizontal values `1`, `2`, and vertical value `1`. A closed circular boundary is centred at the axes' crossing, with its top/bottom and left/right extrema four small cells from that crossing. Two vertical boundaries run through the circle two cells left/right of the vertical axis. Diagonal hatching occupies the two lateral portions inside the circle; the central strip and the exterior remain unhatched. The circle and vertical region edges appear solid, not dashed.
- Right panel: source labels б), `x`, `y`, `O`, horizontal `1` and vertical `1`. Two solid diagonal boundaries meet on the vertical axis two small cells above the horizontal axis; they cross the horizontal axis two small cells left/right of the vertical axis. They extend toward the frame edges. Diagonal hatching fills the left-facing region between these boundaries, clipped by the top/left/bottom frame; the right-facing region is unhatched. No open-endpoint markers are discernible.
- **Uncertainty:** scan thickness and hatching obscure small local intersections and make exact boundary/axis stroke differentiation, arrowhead presence and pixel endpoints uncertain. The source origin glyph is read as `O`, not asserted as a numeric zero. Manual grid/extrema observations are not crop coordinates, executable geometry assertions, inferred inequality answers, or a FigureSpec. The rough candidate box `[340,1930,1730,610]` was not snapped, cropped or certified.

No modern image was inspected, generated, reused or approved. These source observations do not confer modern-figure, mathematical-answer, render, legibility or display approval.

